{"id":23,"titleZh":"拉丁美洲精神","titleEn":"The Latin American Spirit","date":"1963-03-08","dateZh":"1963 年 3 月 8 日","concepts":"多重切分音、拉美打击乐、欧非印第安融合","thesis":"拉丁美洲音乐不只是舞厅娱乐，它融合欧洲、非洲鼓点与印第安传统，靠错落出奇的切分重拍建立出严谨活泼的交响性格。","plain":"拉美音乐为什么一听就让人想动脚？关键在两处：第一是旋律与伴奏互相穿插的多重切分音，重拍总避开意料中的位置；第二是极丰富的民族打击乐器音色。哪怕跳过欢快的古巴舞曲，在传统里也始终保留着优雅体面。","scenes":["演完费尔南德斯《巴图克》，伯恩斯坦对着乐队大声数拍子标出卡在第四拍上的固执重音，随后在镜头前敲响并逐一介绍沙槌、响棒、葫芦刮器和锯齿木棒。","女高音达夫拉特与 8 把大提琴共同演唱维拉-洛博斯的《巴西的巴赫风第 5 号》，随后连演墨西哥《森塞玛雅》、科普兰《古巴达松舞曲》及伯恩斯坦新配器的《西区故事》舞曲。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1AJ411m75w","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AJ411m75w","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 拉美精神","duration":"54:05","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/latin-american-spirit","repertoire":[{"composer":"Oscar Lorenzo Fernandez","piece":"Batuque from Reisado do Pastoreio","titleZh":"巴图克舞曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/30/ea/32/30ea323b-eff0-1de9-c84d-fc5addf56407/mzaf_5483549472140561698.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/batuque-finale-from-reisado-do-pastoreio/155666816?i=155667441&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"Batuque (Finale from \"Reisado do pastoreio\")","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Oscar%20Lorenzo%20Fernandez%20Batuque%20from%20Reisado%20do%20Pastoreio+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Oscar%20Lorenzo%20Fernandez%20Batuque%20from%20Reisado%20do%20Pastoreio"},{"composer":"Villa-Lobos","piece":"Bachianas Brasileiras No. 5","titleZh":"巴西的巴赫风第 5 号","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Villa-Lobos%20Bachianas%20Brasileiras%20No.%205+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Villa-Lobos%20Bachianas%20Brasileiras%20No.%205"},{